--TEST--
a local is refused when an anonymous function inside its method declares a parameter of the same name, because the two would be renamed together, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Prices
{
    public function doubled(array<int> $prices): array<int>
    {
        var $pr<|>ice = 2;
        var $twice = fn (int $price): int => $price * 2;
        return [$twice($price)];
    }
}
--REQUEST--
rename to=factor
--EXPECT--
refused: An anonymous function in this code also declares `$price`, so `$price` cannot be renamed here.
